oXcZg-tQoLO7sGkS65zD-bbtbXsIkNQ&oe=6B0327EF"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00001.png", "id": "1414503400503987", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_1414503403837320_677223929602414224_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0u23S-IivqsQ7kNvwFCatdk&_nc_oc=AdoquFTaGKCfOs8WZdQNH7-sR4ppK4BTboe9N6deTRKG8NOEucI8gSHQX_QQqbyDpaI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRixs0fCNwhoV3Fr9tK_UO6KcdT3Gs99YkJir2qOeL-wg&oe=6B031CFC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses is an immersive VR training application designed exclusively for learners enrolled in the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses Micro-Credential Program.\n\nThis hands-on simulation enables learners to develop practical skills in identifying electrical fuse failures, diagnosing circuit-related issues, following proper safety procedures, and performing fuse replacement in a realistic virtual environment. The training experience is built to replicate real-world troubleshooting scenarios, allowing users to practice critical technical procedures in a safe and controlled setting.\n\nThis application is not intended for general public use. Access is restricted only to individuals officially enrolled in the Immerse Learn micro-credential program as part of their interactive skills training and assessment experience.", "short_description": "Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses is a VR training application developed as part of the Immerse Learn Diagnosing and Replacing Fuses Micro-Credential Program. This immersive simulation provides hands-on practice in identifying fuse-related issues, diagnosing faults, and safely replacing fuses in real-world scenarios. Access to this application is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the micro-credential program."}]}, "developer_name": null